  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zfojiw3.png\" alt=\"苦力怕大修标志\">\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\" alt=\"苦力怕大修展示图\">\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"关于本模组\">\n        <h4>苦力怕大修模组用多种不同生物群系专属的苦力怕类型替代了原版苦力怕，有些会比原版更友好哦 :)</h4>\n        <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XIf8yMA1V2U\"\n                title=\"YouTube视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n                allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <h3>您可能还会喜欢</h3>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OMlhHaU.png\" alt=\"苦力怕大修材质包\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>由lord_gogomines制作的材质包，将苦力怕大修内容带入原版Minecraft！</h5>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jUxOI3S.png\" alt=\"苦力怕大修动画包\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>wadoo154制作的苦力怕大修同人动画材质包</h5>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"制作团队\">\n        <dl>\n          <br>\n            <dt>Josh/Joosh - 美术设计</dt>\n            <dt>ThatGravyBoat - 程序开发</dt>\n            <dt>scratchy_sd - 所有苦力怕音效</dt>\n            <dt>ArkticBoi - 概念原画</dt>\n        </dl>\n    </center>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>     \n\n**<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"我们的其他项目\">**\n\n[**奇幻生物**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creatures-and-beasts) 为Minecraft添加奇妙生物的模组！<br>\n[**小动物伙伴**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions) 添加多种可爱动物的模组！<br>\n[**幽灵**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ghost) 为你的世界添加两种友善幽灵生物的模组！<br>\n[**傀儡大修**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/golem-overhaul) 新增9种傀儡类型的模组！<br>\n[**末影人大修**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/enderman-overhaul) 彻底改造原版末影人的模组！<br>\n[**夜灯**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/nightlights) 为Minecraft添加多种新光源的模组！<br>\n[**锋芒毕露**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/lookin-sharp) 为游戏新增60种近战武器！<br>\n[**蛙鸣**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ribbits) 添加充满青蛙村民的全新沼泽村庄！\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" alt=\"Kofi\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://mcmodels.net/vendors/29/joosh\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" alt=\"Mcmodels\">\n        </a>\n    </center> <br>\n<div>",
